1
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:08,010
This is LectureForge, my Multimedia project. It makes lecture recordings shorter.

2
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:12,050
I drop in a sample lecture. Nothing gets uploaded.

3
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:17,010
The app finds the silent parts by itself. Six gaps in this file.

4
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:21,480
Every gap is listed. I can keep one with a single click.

5
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:28,050
Now I speed it up to one and a half times. Pitch stays natural.

6
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:34,800
Then I export. It cuts, stretches, and encodes an MP3, all inside the browser.

7
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:50,160
Done. A smaller MP3, saved straight to my computer.

8
00:00:50,310 --> 00:00:54,830
Offline, private, and free. Thanks for watching.


